<title>ROMANIA: TABLE-Romania Bancorex gross profit slips in 1996.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Romania Bancorex gross profit slips in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full-year to December 31</p>
<p>				(billions of leu unless stated)</p>
<p>				     1996	     1995</p>
<p> gross profit		    170.0	   210.0</p>
<p> net profit			170.0	   115.6</p>
<p> total assets		 12,975.5	 6,024.6</p>
<p> share capital		    93.2	    93.2</p>
<p> dividend total		   16.7	    N.A.</p>
<p>NOTE: Banca Romana de Comert Exterior Bancorex SA is a leading state-run bank, handling a large part of Romania's foreign trade. Figures reported are in nominal terms and were audited by Coopers &amp; Lybrand. Year-on-year inflation was 56.9 percent last year, up from 27.8 percent in 1995.</p>
<p>-- Bucharest Newsroom 40-1 3120264</p>
